---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Cum porti pantaloni cu snur lung moda urbana';
const description = 'Invata cum sa porti pantaloni cu snur lung in tinute moda urbana, unisex, casual si de vara. Inspira-te acum!';
const canonical = 'https://pantalonicusnurlung.ro/cum-sa-porti-pantaloni-cu-snur/';
const image = '/pantaloni-barbati-largi-negri-snur-casual.jpg';
const schema = { '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'WebPage', name:title, url:canonical, image:new URL(image, canonical).href };
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} image={image} type="website" schema={schema}>
<section id="hero"><div class="hero-bg"></div><div class="container"><div class="hero-inner-wrapper"><div class="hero-content"><div class="hero-badge">Ghid urban 2026</div><h1 class="hero-h1">Cum porti<br/><span class="line2">pantaloni cu snur lung</span></h1><p class="hero-sub">Tinutele bune pornesc de la proportii: pantaloni largi, tricou oversized, incaltaminte cu volum si accesorii curate.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd" class="btn-primary">Vezi colectia</a><a href="/ghid-marimi-pantaloni-cu-snur" class="btn-ghost">Ghid marimi</a></div></div></div><div class="hero-stats"><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">100<span>%</span></div><div class="stat-label">Calitate superioara</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Unisex</div><div class="stat-label">Purtat si de femei</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">1-3<span>zile</span></div><div class="stat-label">Timp livrare</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Card</div><div class="stat-label">sau ramburs</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="lookbook"><div class="container"><div class="services-header reveal"><div><span class="section-tag">// Purtat si de ea</span><h2 class="section-h2">Croiala de barbati? Mai degraba <em>unisex.</em></h2></div><p class="section-lead">Desi multe modele vin din zona moda masculina, croielile lejere si snurul lung le fac potrivite si pentru tinute feminine, moda urbana si relaxate.</p></div><div class="lookbook-grid reveal reveal-delay-1"><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/pantaloni-femei-streetwear-snur-lung.png" alt="Tinuta urbana dama cu pantaloni cu snur lung" title="Tinuta urbana dama" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Tinuta urbana dama</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/tinuta-unisex-pantaloni-largi-snur-extra-lung.png" alt="Tinuta unisex cu pantaloni largi si snur extra lung" title="Croiala unisex" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Croiala unisex</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/outfit-casual-tricou-pantaloni-negri-snur-lung.png" alt="Tinuta casual cu tricou si pantaloni negri cu snur lung" title="Casual urban" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Casual urban</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/pantaloni-baggy-fete-snur-lung-atelieraxd.png" alt="Pantaloni baggy pentru fete cu snur lung AtelierAXD" title="Stil baggy" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Stil baggy</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/detaliu-snur-lung-pantaloni-oversized-dama.png" alt="Detaliu snur lung la pantaloni oversized de dama" title="Detalii oversized" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Detalii oversized</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/moda-urbana-pantaloni-unisex-cu-snur-lung.png" alt="Moda urbana cu pantaloni unisex cu snur lung" title="Moda urbana" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Moda urbana</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="split-grid"><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Cu tricou oversized</h2><p>Tricoul larg echilibreaza volumul pantalonilor si lasa snurul lung sa ramana vizibil.</p></article><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Cu incaltaminte sport</h2><p>Incaltamintea sport masiva sau minimalista functioneaza bine, in functie de cat de puternic vrei sa fie aspectul.</p></article><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Pe sezon</h2><p>Primavara si toamna merg cu hanorac, vara cu tricou, iar acasa cu piese moi si relaxate.</p></article><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Unisex</h2><p>Croiala lejera face ca pantalonii cu snur lung sa functioneze natural si in tinute feminine.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="content-panel reveal" style="text-align:center"><span class="section-tag">// cumpara acum</span><h2 class="section-h2" style="margin:0 auto 18px">Pantaloni cu snur lung AtelierAXD</h2><p style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 26px">Daca ai ales stilul, mergi direct in magazin pentru modele disponibile, plata si livrare.</p><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd" class="btn-primary">pantaloni cu snur lung atelieraxd</a></div></div></section></Layout>
